<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="01">
<name>Engine</name>
<section id="10006_S000J" variety="S000J">
<name>Engine Control</name>
<ttl id="10006_S000J_74WIJ_T00FO" variety="T00FO">
<name>EFI System (2GR-FE)</name>
<para id="RM00000211500SX" category="C" type-id="800K3" name-id="066OD-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P1604</dtccode>
<dtcname>Poor Starting</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000211500SX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAT00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The DTC is output when the engine does not start or takes a long time to start even though the STA signal is input. The freeze frame data, which stores the conditions when the DTC was output, can be checked using TaSCAN. Serviceability is improved by making it possible to check the engine operating condition at the time of poor starting using the freeze frame data. Also, since poor starting caused by running out of fuel is also detected, it is necessary to check whether the vehicle has run out of fuel before starting work.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="5.01in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction status 3. Malfunction duration 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P1604</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>STA signal ON</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine speed less than 500r/min</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>7 seconds or more (at engine coolant temperature of 20°C)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000211500SX_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAU00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If other DTCs are displayed, troubleshoot the corresponding DTCs first.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Since DTC P1604 differs from conventional diagnostic trouble codes, the diagnostic procedure below is described as 1 possible method.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000211500SX_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000211500SX_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAV00000">
<testtitle>Check Whether Engine Cranks</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check whether the engine cranks.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000211500SX_03_0002" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000211500SX_03_0004" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211500SX_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAW00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the screen display of SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000008YS014X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.03in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.10in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Only P1604 is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Other DTCs are displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000211500SX_03_0003" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000211500SX_03_0005" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211500SX_03_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAX00000">
<testtitle>Check Freeze Frame Data</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Use the time-series freeze frame data to check the data at and after DTC detection, to assist with troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the screen display of SST (TaSCAN), check the time-series freeze frame data, and check the vehicle condition at the time of poor starting. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CD2022X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data for the battery condition.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Short Circuit Name</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Auxiliary Battery Voltage</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>BATT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data for the cranking condition.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Short Circuit Name</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Speed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ESPD</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Speed at Starter OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>STER</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Starter ON Count in Current Trip</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>STON</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Compare the freeze frame data for each temperature at the time of poor starting.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Short Circuit Name</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Coolant Temperature</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>THW</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Intake Air Temperature</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>THA</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Oil Temperature</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>EOT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Outside Temperature</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>AMT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data for engine control at the time of starting.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Short Circuit Name</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Intake Air Volume</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>MAF</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Throttle Opening</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>THPO</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ISC Flow Rate</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ISCF</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ISC Opening</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ISCO</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data before poor starting occurred.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Short Circuit Name</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Previous Trip Distance</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>PTRD</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Intake air temperature during previous trip</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>RIAT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Oil Temperature in Previous Trip</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>REOT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Ambient Temperature in Previous Trip</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>RAMT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the items above and perform the test again.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Based on the freeze data and reproduction test, compare with the reference values in the ECU Data Monitor list (<xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000CCZ03QX"/>) and identify the malfunctioning area.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.97in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.16in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Malfunctioning part can be identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Malfunctioning part cannot be identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000211500SX_03_0007" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000211500SX_03_0006" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211500SX_03_0004">
<testtitle>Go to the related circuit inspection shown in the List by Symptom<xref label="Seep01" href="X39400000QW01PD"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211500SX_03_0005">
<testtitle>Go to Related DTC Chart<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001KT7004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211500SX_03_0006">
<testtitle>Inspection for Intermittent Problems<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CD101YX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211500SX_03_0007">
<testtitle>Inspect and Repair Malfunctioning Area</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
